    "body": "> but something needs to trigger the paint event when the canvas size changes\n\nIsn't the paint event fired when the canvas size change? Testing on current Canary it looks like it does even if the content has absolute size set, and that's what I'd expect (maybe we should make the specs PR more precise on this aspect btw).\n\nBut we should probably focus back on the non-HiC case a little, and see whether exposing these values outside of the ResizeObserver really is a potential footgun or not, and whether there would be a better solution that would still handle the existing issue.  ",
